1. **Changed initial `index` from 0 to 1**: This ensures that when we enter the loop, we've already processed `arr[0]` by setting `maxVal := arr[0]`. This makes the invariant `exists j :: 0 <= j < index && arr[j] == maxVal` true from the start.

