Looking at the previous code and the instructions, I can see several issues that need to be fixed:

1. The inner loop invariants are incorrect - they don't properly track the bubble sort progress
2. The outer loop invariant `forall i :: 0 <= i <= lastUnsorted < n ==> arr[i] <= arr[lastUnsorted]` is too strong
3. The inner loop needs better invariants to track the bubbling process
