   - This matches the "last 1" requirement
4. **Maintains proper invariants**: The loop invariant ensures that all elements to the right of the current index are 0

The method:
- Searches from the end of the array towards the beginning
- When it finds a 1, it returns that index immediately
- If it encounters a 0, it flips it to 1 and continues searching
- Returns -1 if no 1 was found in the entire array

The test method verifies that:
- It correctly finds the last 1 at index 4
- All elements from the found index backward are set to 1
- The array is properly modified in-place
